part tt_2
  tally 1
  law
  note "TT-2 · The first-home exemption. A buyer's share is exempt where the buyer owned no dwelling and no share on the purchase day and at any time in the 5 years before (.1); an inherited share of 50 % or less doesn't count (.2); each co-buyer judged alone (.3)."
  note "Governs purchases from 2023-01-01 only: a purchase before has no candidate row, so the exemption is never read for it (L §4.6)."

source tt_2 "Transfer Tax Act, TT-2 The first-home exemption (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

input tt2_lookback_years: int question "How many years before the purchase must the buyer have owned no dwelling (TT-2 .1)?"

version tt2_v1
  cite tt_2
  governs 2023-01-01..
  known 2022-09-29
  enters 2023-01-01
  note "TT-2 v1, in force 2023-01-01 until replaced, published 2022-09-29; governs purchases from 2023-01-01."
  tt2_lookback_years = 5 "TT-2 v1 .1"
